160
00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.910
This job afforded me a lot of flexibility.

161
00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.550
And more than that, though,

162
00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:28.310
it gave me a safe place to come and laugh and escape.

163
00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:30.650
I felt a sense of purpose here.

164
00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:32.590
It is important to me.

165
00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:34.910
And I cannot thank you all enough.

166
00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.550
And this is a thank you to our office

167
00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:41.570
ladies community as well for this space existing, I guess.

168
00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.050
And I like being in it.

169
00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:44.970
And we have a

170
00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:46.150
really good episode today.

171
00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:49.170
I want everyone to hear it and enjoy it.

172
00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.770
Well, lady, we love you.

173
00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.010
And we are

174
00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:54.770
here for you.

