1297
00:58:33.320 --> 00:58:34.240
Oh my gosh.

1298
00:58:34.240 --> 00:58:36.360
The writers must have loved writing for Andy.

1299
00:58:36.620 --> 00:58:37.820
Rest in my vokes.

