1314
00:59:09.420 --> 00:59:13.160
So he pulled an Irish exit and left before anyone noticed.

1315
00:59:13.180 --> 00:59:14.040
No hard feelings.

1316
00:59:14.160 --> 00:59:15.080
No feelings at all.

1317
