No one can guess what Jim is thinking, except Jim and Dwight say seahorse at the same time.

1329
00:59:46.780 --> 00:59:47.640
That's right.

1330
00:59:48.280 --> 00:59:49.860
What are the odds of that?

1331
00:59:50.680 --> 00:59:54.140
I mean, they're pretty good based on how this went down.

1332
00:59:54.380 --> 00:59:55.580
Don't you think so?

1333
00:59:55.720 --> 00:59:55.860
Yeah.

1334
