1345
01:00:11.140 --> 01:00:12.820
This is an acting exercise.

1346
01:00:13.700 --> 01:00:18.900
Kristen Wiig and Fred Armisen on Saturday Night Live have a bit where they-

1347
01:00:18.900 --> 01:00:20.140
They are the best at it.

1348
01:00:20.260 --> 01:00:21.440
But they're singing.

1349
01:00:21.440 --> 01:00:22.340
I know.

1350
01:00:22.420 --> 01:00:22.960
As well.

1351
01:00:23.140 --> 01:00:26.180
And then they're having to create a story, like new information.

1352
01:00:26.640 --> 01:00:28.640
It is so good.

1353
01:00:28.920 --> 01:00:29.220
Mm-hmm.

1354
01:00:29.320 --> 01:00:30.200
It's the beSt.

1355
01:00:30.400 --> 01:00:30.780
It is.

1356
01:00:30.780 --> 01:00:31.780
It's the best at this bit.

1357
01:00:32.060 --> 01:00:32.800
It's so great.

1358
01:00:32.800 --> 01:00:36.620
The whole bit is they have to sing a song on Weekend Update, and it comes across like

1359
01:00:36.620 --> 01:00:38.900
