1360
01:00:39.320 --> 01:00:40.380
And they are.

1361
01:00:40.600 --> 01:00:40.780
Yeah.

1362
01:00:40.780 --> 01:00:44.220
And visually, they're having to watch each other to see what words they're saying.

1363
01:00:44.420 --> 01:00:45.860
We should put one of them in stories.

1364
01:00:45.880 --> 01:00:46.240
We have to.

1365
01:00:46.240 --> 01:00:46.760
It's so funny.

1366
01:00:47.360 --> 01:00:47.600
All right.

1367
