Once again, Dwight is the only person who knows how to solve this problem properly.

1380
01:01:21.640 --> 01:01:22.080
That's right.

1381
01:01:22.320 --> 01:01:23.260
It's uncanny.

1382
01:01:23.580 --> 01:01:24.040
I know.

1383
01:01:24.800 --> 01:01:25.240
Uncanny.

1384
01:01:25.580 --> 01:01:25.780
Mm-hmm.

1385
01:01:26.140 --> 01:01:28.880
Jim has a lot of clipboard acting in this episode.

1386
01:01:29.060 --> 01:01:30.100
A lot of pen clicking.

1387
01:01:30.100 --> 01:01:32.640
A lot of pen clicking, writing stuff on a clipboard.

1388
01:01:32.880 --> 01:01:33.440
Checkmark making.

1389
01:01:33.680 --> 01:01:34.140
Checkmarking.

1390
01:01:34.420 --> 01:01:35.560
He's a clipboard guy.

1391
01:01:35.740 --> 01:01:36.580
He really is.

1392
01:01:37.120 --> 01:01:42.560
Well, back in line for America's Next Acapella Sensation, Andy and Casey are really bonding

1393
01:01:42.560 --> 01:01:46.680
over the fact that they're getting annoyed with other people that they think are going

1394
01:01:46.680 --> 01:01:48.360
to be pulling at the heartstrings of the judges.

