01:03:04.170 --> 01:03:11.410
actors were so lovely and just a fun hang, you know, and that isn't always the case, but

1424
01:03:11.410 --> 01:03:13.070
everyone was so excited to be there.

1425
01:03:13.190 --> 01:03:17.750
I think there was, you know, everyone was sort of a fan of the office and everyone was

1426
01:03:17.750 --> 01:03:20.470
really bringing like a backstory to their characters.

1427
01:03:20.470 --> 01:03:21.550
So that was really fun.

1428
01:03:22.210 --> 01:03:27.410
You know, some of my favorite things to shoot are like situations like this where you're in

1429
01:03:27.410 --> 01:03:34.170
this like big line or big group of people for multiple scenes because you really do kind

1430
01:03:34.170 --> 01:03:38.990
of end up making up your own stories in the background and they become some of the most

1431
01:03:38.990 --> 01:03:39.870
fun shoot days.

1432
01:03:40.310 --> 01:03:40.490
Yeah.

