He says, save my place in line.

1460
01:04:48.750 --> 01:04:49.650
And he takes off.

1461
01:04:49.770 --> 01:04:50.050
Yeah.

1462
01:04:50.430 --> 01:04:51.810
What's Andy got up his sleeve?

1463
01:04:52.090 --> 01:04:53.950
Oh, something good.

1464
01:04:54.110 --> 01:04:54.390
Oh.

1465
01:04:55.170 --> 01:04:56.970
We're over at Caffeine Corner now.

1466
01:04:57.110 --> 01:04:58.730
And I'll be damned if they don't have donuts.

1467
01:04:59.510 --> 01:05:00.310
Caffeine Corner.

1468
