1479
01:05:23.350 --> 01:05:24.590
Daryl couldn't be happier.

1480
01:05:24.730 --> 01:05:25.610
He's so stoked.

1481
01:05:25.750 --> 01:05:27.990
He's going to meet all of his sports heroes.

1482
01:05:28.190 --> 01:05:29.710
He'll go to 32 different cities.

1483
01:05:29.790 --> 01:05:33.110
He can't believe that Jim is happier at Dunder Mifflin.

1484
01:05:33.490 --> 01:05:33.770
Yeah.

1485
01:05:34.230 --> 01:05:38.210
He says he's not having any second thoughts about leaving Athlead.

1486
01:05:38.370 --> 01:05:39.870
And Pam is like, nope.

1487
01:05:40.130 --> 01:05:41.650
I mean, he seems happy.

1488
01:05:41.850 --> 01:05:42.850
He seems happy.

1489
01:05:42.850 --> 01:05:46.430
He's just going to try to recreate Office Olympics, pretty much.

1490
01:05:46.430 --> 01:05:47.910
Maybe a call for help.

1491
01:05:48.390 --> 01:05:49.650
We're in the warehouse.

1492
01:05:50.250 --> 01:05:54.470
And there is a coffee obstacle course set up.

1493
01:05:54.710 --> 01:05:56.610
Yeah, you have two cups of hot coffee.

1494
01:05:56.690 --> 01:05:57.990
Your boss needs his coffee.

1495
01:05:58.270 --> 01:05:59.130
Here's the thing.

1496
01:05:59.270 --> 01:06:00.410
It's super piping hot.

1497
01:06:00.930 --> 01:06:06.150
You got to step over three different sizes of, like, stacks of paper.

1498
01:06:06.150 --> 01:06:10.610
And then you go through this chair obstacle spinny thing.

1499
01:06:10.830 --> 01:06:12.790
Yeah, the chairs are upside down.

1500
01:06:12.950 --> 01:06:13.990
The wheels are spinning.

1501
01:06:14.390 --> 01:06:18.110
This obstacle course was originally scripted to be outside.

1502
01:06:18.370 --> 01:06:20.730
But Dave Rogers moved it into the warehouse.

1503
01:06:20.790 --> 01:06:22.870
He said he moved it for two reasons.

1504
01:06:23.430 --> 01:06:33.890
One, because he thought it would be easier for Aaron to spot Daryl at the end if they were in the warehouse than if they were outside in the alley.

1505
01:06:33.890 --> 01:06:42.090
But also, he said whenever we did a lot of scenes outside, we would all get hot and grouchy.

1506
01:06:42.830 --> 01:06:46.610
And so he was like, let's move it inside, folks.

1507
01:06:47.050 --> 01:06:47.530
Save myself.

1508
01:06:47.810 --> 01:06:48.110
Exactly.

1509
01:06:48.630 --> 01:06:49.650
Some grouchy folks.

1510
01:06:50.450 --> 01:06:52.990
Phyllis is up first on the obstacle course.

1511
01:06:53.410 --> 01:06:55.730
And she's moving too slowly.

1512
01:06:56.330 --> 01:06:57.650
Dwight can't take it.

1513
01:06:57.910 --> 01:07:00.350
He, like, grabs the coffee from her, starts running through it.

1514
01:07:00.350 --> 01:07:01.650
He's spilling coffee on himself.

1515
01:07:01.650 --> 01:07:02.810
It's, like, burning him.

1516
01:07:02.810 --> 01:07:03.590
But you know what?

1517
01:07:03.590 --> 01:07:07.170
He's going to get that coffee to his boss, which is himself.

1518
01:07:07.910 --> 01:07:13.510
I would like to award myself a Razzie for my performance in this scene.

1519
01:07:13.710 --> 01:07:14.310
Oh, my God.

1520
01:07:14.310 --> 01:07:16.030
I could barely watch it.

1521
01:07:16.470 --> 01:07:21.850
Could I be telegraphing or showing or indicating anymore?

1522
01:07:22.830 --> 01:07:26.570
Everyone, if you want to be an actor, don't do what I'm doing in this scene.

1523
01:07:26.690 --> 01:07:26.830
Stop it.

1524
01:07:27.030 --> 01:07:27.750
I'm serious.

1525
01:07:28.110 --> 01:07:32.170
