I love that Dave's voice got in the episode because I love him.

1631
01:11:55.550 --> 01:11:57.250
But I also was like, well, that was quick.

1632
01:11:57.790 --> 01:12:03.370
Well, you know, we've heard the documentarian's voice one other time, and it was Dave at that

1633
01:12:03.370 --> 01:12:03.850
time as well.

1634
01:12:04.070 --> 01:12:09.350
You know, Dave said originally he just recorded his voice as like a temporary voice track.

1635
01:12:09.730 --> 01:12:09.810
Yeah.

1636
01:12:10.050 --> 01:12:14.630
And that the intention was that Greg Daniels would provide the voice of the documentarian.

1637
01:12:14.950 --> 01:12:17.510
But Greg was like, no, I want it to be you.

