Tell Philip that a stupid little baby wish came true.

1642
01:12:28.730 --> 01:12:31.250
But Angela and Oscar don't have time to deal with this.

1643
01:12:31.390 --> 01:12:33.290
They're trying to get Philip down for a nap.

1644
01:12:33.470 --> 01:12:38.630
They've created kind of a bed out of the bottom drawer of the file can, but they pulled

1645
01:12:38.630 --> 01:12:38.970
it out.

1646
01:12:39.070 --> 01:12:40.590
They put a bunch of blankets in.

1647
01:12:40.690 --> 01:12:41.750
They've made a little bassinet.

1648
01:12:41.870 --> 01:12:42.710
Like a little bassinet.

1649
01:12:42.830 --> 01:12:46.330
They have a little mattress thing on the bottom and some of his stuffed animals.

1650
01:12:46.870 --> 01:12:49.150
But Philip is too excited to nap.

1651
