Yeah.

1652
01:12:50.090 --> 01:12:53.170
Angela said he's very excited to be surrounded by all this paper.

1653
01:12:53.170 --> 01:12:57.570
And he even ate some of the paper, which Dwight overhears and is like, well, that's the

1654
01:12:57.570 --> 01:12:58.610
best tasting paper.

1655
01:12:59.310 --> 01:12:59.650
Hmm.

1656
01:13:00.110 --> 01:13:00.490
Hmm.

1657
01:13:01.130 --> 01:13:05.070
Meanwhile, in the break room, Phyllis, Aaron and Meredith are confronting Daryl about the

1658
01:13:05.070 --> 01:13:06.550
fact that he left without saying goodbye.

1659
01:13:07.130 --> 01:13:07.410
Mm hmm.

1660
01:13:07.910 --> 01:13:11.130
Now, Stanley's there, too, but he's just kind of eating his lunch in the background.

1661
01:13:11.270 --> 01:13:14.230
He's weighing in, but he's not as passionate about this problem.

1662
01:13:14.470 --> 01:13:15.790
Oscar shows up there, too.

1663
01:13:16.330 --> 01:13:17.170
Oh, you're right.

1664
01:13:17.350 --> 01:13:17.550
Yeah.

1665
01:13:18.210 --> 01:13:21.310
Clearly, they love Daryl and they wanted more time with him.

1666
01:13:21.430 --> 01:13:23.850
And they're really bummed he did the Irish exit.

1667
01:13:24.050 --> 01:13:26.710
Daryl says, wow, they're definitely in a weird mood.

1668
01:13:26.710 --> 01:13:29.190
I picked the wrong day to return a truck.

1669
01:13:29.430 --> 01:13:30.830
I have a mug catch.

1670
01:13:31.070 --> 01:13:31.850
Oh, let's hear it.

1671
01:13:32.050 --> 01:13:35.110
Both Meredith and Creed are using their mugs from customer survey.

1672
01:13:35.670 --> 01:13:36.070
Aw.

1673
01:13:36.330 --> 01:13:37.710
That was season five.

1674
01:13:37.870 --> 01:13:38.330
Yes.

1675
01:13:38.330 --> 01:13:41.450
I just love the dedication to this mug thing.

1676
01:13:41.630 --> 01:13:42.050
Me, too.

1677
01:13:42.870 --> 01:13:47.710
Well, in Dwight's office, him and Esther are now having a picnic and just standing right

1678
01:13:47.710 --> 01:13:53.030
outside the window of his office, Angela and Pam are having a whole conversation and Angela's

