1690
01:14:16.270 --> 01:14:17.030
He's smiling.

1691
01:14:17.570 --> 01:14:18.930
Dwight clocks all of this.

1692
01:14:18.930 --> 01:14:21.150
He can't even focus on what Esther's saying.

1693
01:14:21.670 --> 01:14:21.850
Yeah.

