He's going to pass this off to his number two.

1751
01:16:53.930 --> 01:16:55.330
Unless he can't handle it.

1752
01:16:55.450 --> 01:16:57.090
And Dwight assures him he can.

1753
01:16:57.850 --> 01:16:58.670
Dun, dun, dun.

1754
